# T'Pol, Vulcan Representative {4}{U}, 4/3: "When T'Pol enters, tap target creature an opponent controls and put two stun
# counters on it" (CR 122.1d, 701.26a). Cast on turn 3 off five moxen, its trigger refuses Bot1's own Ornithopter (not an
# opponent's) and Bot2's Mox Jet (no creature), and takes Bot2's Memnite rather than its Phyrexian Walker: tapped, two stun
# counters. In Bot2's untap step on turn 4 one counter is removed instead of the Memnite untapping, so it stays tapped with
# one counter left; the Ornithopter is untouched.

